 * PATCHED DTSI – Orange Pi 5 Ultra
 * File: rk3588-orangepi-5-ultra-r08a-lp5-2736.dtsi
 *
 * Revision note:
 * r08a - fixed DTC syntax issue.
 *      - Based on r06 CPU 2.4GHz / 1.05V big-cluster patch.
